API surface: server side

Here is the MVP API surface I’d aim for.

1. App creation
createAgentApp(config)

Config:

type AgentAppConfig = {
  apiKey: string;
  baseUrl?: string;
};
2. Define an agent
defineAgent(config)

Config:

type AgentConfig = {
  name: string;
  model: string | ModelResolver;
  system?: string;
  tools?: ToolDefinition[];
  temperature?: number;
  maxTokens?: number;
  memory?: {
    strategy?: "last_n" | "summary";
    maxMessages?: number;
  };
};
3. Define a tool
tool(config)

Config:

type ToolDefinition<TInput = any, TResult = any> = {
  name: string;
  description: string;
  inputSchema: object;
  execute: (input: TInput, ctx: ToolContext) => Promise<TResult>;
};

Tool context might include:

type ToolContext = {
  sessionId: string;
  userId?: string;
  metadata?: Record<string, unknown>;
  http: {
    get: (url: string) => Promise<any>;
    post: (url: string, body: unknown) => Promise<any>;
