The crisp product pitch

This MVP is basically:

Stripe for embedding a real-time agent into your app

Or more literally:

Realtime chat backend for AI agents, with tools and model portability built in

That is much easier to understand than a general orchestration platform.

My strongest recommendation on architecture

For MVP, choose the simplest reliable stack:

Your backend
API + runtime: Node/TypeScript
DB: Postgres
transport: SSE first
background jobs: small queue for tool invocations/timeouts
cache/pubsub: Redis if needed for stream fanout
Customer side
backend SDK for agent/tool registration
frontend SDK for chat UI and stream consumption

That is enough.

